sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor Trigger as Admin / User / SP
	participant Term as terminate choke-point
	participant Port as LOGOUT_PROPAGATION_PORT
	participant Engine as Back-channel engine
	participant Queue as SamlBackchannelLogout DB
	participant Sched as Retry scheduler
	participant SPb as Other SP SOAP SLO

	rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
	Note over Trigger,SPb: Authoritative-local, best-effort propagation
	Trigger->>Term: terminate with optional excludeSpConnectionId
	Term->>Term: Flip session status to terminated, always succeeds local
	Term->>Port: propagateLogout ssoSessionId reason exclude
	Port->>Engine: real impl, Noop default is local-only
	end

	rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
	Note over Engine,Queue: Enqueue per participating SP
	Engine->>Queue: upsert pending row per active SP with sloSoapUrl, dedup by session x SP
	Engine->>Queue: skipped_no_endpoint for SPs without SOAP, audited
	Engine-->>Term: enqueue awaited, delivery fire-and-forget, never blocks caller
	end

	rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
	Note over Engine,SPb: First pass plus retries, signed and verified
	Engine->>Queue: claim row to in_flight, per-SP serialization and global cap
	Engine->>SPb: POST SOAP 1.1 plus IdP-signed LogoutRequest, stable requestId
	SPb-->>Engine: SOAP LogoutResponse, verify signature InResponseTo Status
	alt success or partial
		Engine->>Queue: status succeeded or partial, audit, update SP indicator
	else failure
		Engine->>Queue: status failed, attempts plus 1, exponential nextRetryAt
		Sched->>Queue: tick picks due rows, at MAX_RETRIES mark given_up plus notifier
	end
	end
